$DATUM 8-((R)-1-(3,5-difluorophenylamino)ethyl)-2-morpholino-4-oxo-N-((S)-1-phenylethyl)-4H-chromene-6-carboxamide
(76) EDCI (102 mg, 0.53 mmol) was added in one portion to 66a (200 mg,
0.35 mmol), (S)-1-phenylethylamine (64 mg, 0.53 mmol) and
2-hydroxy-pyridine N-oxide (47 mg, 0.42 mmol) dissolved in DCM (2 mL).
The resulting solution was stirred at rt for 60 min. More EDCI (50 mg)
was added and the mixture was stirred at rt for 15 min more. The solution
was washed with a 10% aqueous citric acid solution, water and brine then
purified by flash chromatography eluting with 0 to 10% methanol in ethyl
acetate. The solvent was evaporated to dryness. 76 (185 mg, 98 %) as an
white solid. 1H NMR (CDCl3): 1.60 (m, 6H), 3.50 (m, 4H), 3.81 (m, 4H),
4.91 (br q, 1H),5.30 (m, 1H), 5.60 (s, 1H),5.97 (m, 2H), 6.11 (m, 1H),
6.90 (m, 1H), 7.40-7.30 (m, 5H), 8.29 (s, 1H), 8.38 (s, 1H), MS-ESI m/z
534 [MH+].
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Discovery of
(R)-8-(1-(3,5-Difluorophenylamino)ethyl)-N,N-dimethyl-2-morpholino-4-oxo-4H-chromene-6-carboxamide
(AZD8186): A Potent and Selective Inhibitor of PI3Kβ and PI3Kδ for the
Treatment of PTEN-Deficient Cancers
